  "description": "<p>The Amplify Down 900 sleeping bag is the ideal versatile bag for more extreme weather conditions. Designed for expeditions to Mt. Kenya, Kilimanjaro and Everest Base Camp. Comfort rated at -8°C, and transition rated to -15°C, this bag will keep you insulated and comfortable when needed most.</p>\n<p><em>This sleeping bag comes with a </em><strong><em>right-side zip</em></strong><em>. A left-side zip is available </em><strong><em>on request</em></strong><em>.</em></p>",
